# Exceptions: documentation demo assets are intentionally version-controlled
!demo-gifs/*.gif
!demo-gifs/**/*.gif
!Docs/docfx/images/*.gif
!Docs/docfx/images/*.png

# Built JS bundles (output of MegaForm.UI build → Assets/js). Source is MegaForm.UI/src + Assets/ts.
# NOTE: `Assets/js/**` (not `Assets/js/`) — git will not look inside an EXCLUDED DIRECTORY, so the
# re-includes below only work when the contents, rather than the folder itself, are the excluded thing.
Assets/js/**
!Assets/js/plugins/
!Assets/js/plugins/vendor/
!Assets/js/plugins/vendor/quill/

# [RichTextGuard 2026-07-29] Two exceptions, because BuildPackage-DNN.ps1 now HARD-FAILS the pack
# when they are missing (Assert-RequiredFile) and neither can be rebuilt from this repo:
#   · quill.min.js — third-party vendor drop, not built from our sources (same class as
#     reactflow.min.js, which the pack script syncs from a developer-local folder).
#   · megaform-widget-rich-text.js — the Razor Blog admin editor. It has NO .ts source anywhere
#     in the repo, exactly like megaform-widget-calculator.js did before it was ported back.
#     Tracking the build output keeps a clean checkout packable; porting the source into
#     MegaForm.UI/src/widgets/plugins/ is the real fix and is still owed.
!Assets/js/plugins/megaform-widget-rich-text.js
!Assets/js/plugins/vendor/
!Assets/js/plugins/vendor/quill/
!Assets/js/plugins/vendor/quill/*.js

# Large self-hosted font binaries (deployment assets, re-mirrored from Google Fonts)
Assets/fonts/

# Deployed / synced asset copies (BuildTS syncs Assets/ → these; pure duplicates of source)
MegaForm.Oqtane.Server/wwwroot/Modules/MegaForm/
MegaForm.Web/wwwroot/megaform/
MegaForm.Web.Host/wwwroot/megaform/
DesktopModules/

# Backups, delivery bundles, packaging output
_mfbackup*/
_megaform_backup*/
_mf_*backup*/
fix21_src/
CustomerDelivery/
*.zip
*.7z

